<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58710" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κολοφώνιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from Colophon</i> in Ionia, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.147
			</span></i>, etc.; K. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα</span>, a figure
			of speech, such as using <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κεφαλὴ τῷ
				ἀνθρώπῳ</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ
			-που</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Lesb.Gramm.
				7
			</span></i>: Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
			Κολοφωνία</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥητίνη</span>), <i>Colophonian gum, resin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.475
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				1.52.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαμμωνία</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.170
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κολοφώνιον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδημα</span>), τό,
			kind of <i>shoe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Rhinth.
				4
			</span></i>; also, a measure used in Egypt, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.</u>
				1166
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1265
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; but also, a kind of <i>vegetable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				419.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
